# Revisions listed here are skipped by `git blame` — use it for bulk, behaviour-
# neutral commits (e.g. a repo-wide `ruff format`) so blame still points at the
# commit that last changed the logic.
#
# Enable locally once:
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
# GitHub applies this file automatically.
#
# When you run a one-shot `ruff format` over the whole tree, commit it on its
# own and add the full 40-character commit hash below, one per line, e.g.:
#   9a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d0e1f2a3b4c5d6e7f8a9b   # ruff format: whole tree
